Types of Kubernetes Services
1️ClusterIP (Most Common)

Default service type.

	Accessible inside the cluster only.

		Service IP: 10.96.1.10

	Example:

	spec:
	  type: ClusterIP

	Use case:

		Backend services

		Database services

		Internal APIs


NodePort: 

Exposes service on Node IP + Port.

	Example:

	spec:
	  type: NodePort

	Access:

		NodeIP:30007

	Example:

		192.168.1.20:30007

LoadBalancer

	Creates external load balancer in cloud environments.

Example in:

	Amazon Web Services

	Google Cloud

	Microsoft Azure

Example:

	spec:
	  type: LoadBalancer

Access:

	External IP → Service → Pods

